{"page":13,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:84","surah":2,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ أَخَذْنَا مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ لَا تَسْفِكُونَ دِمَآءَكُمْ وَلَا تُخْرِجُونَ أَنفُسَكُم مِّن دِيَـٰرِكُمْ ثُمَّ أَقْرَرْتُمْ وَأَنتُمْ تَشْهَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We took a pledge from you, ‘Do not shed one another’s blood or drive one another from your homelands.’ You acknowledged it at the time, and you can testify to this.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذْنَا","en_gloss":"We took","transliteration":"akhadhnā","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqakum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَسْفِكُونَ","en_gloss":"will you shed","transliteration":"tasfikūna","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دِمَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your blood","transliteration":"dimāakum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُخْرِجُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) evict","transliteration":"tukh'rijūna","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنفُسَكُم","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusakum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your homes","transliteration":"diyārikum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَقْرَرْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you ratified","transliteration":"aqrartum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَشْهَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(were) witnessing","transliteration":"tashhadūna","verse_key":"2:84"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:84"}]},{"verse_key":"2:85","surah":2,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ أَنتُمْ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ تَقْتُلُونَ أَنفُسَكُمْ وَتُخْرِجُونَ فَرِيقًا مِّنكُم مِّن دِيَـٰرِهِمْ تَظَـٰهَرُونَ عَلَيْهِم بِٱلْإِثْمِ وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ وَإِن يَأْتُوكُمْ أُسَـٰرَىٰ تُفَـٰدُوهُمْ وَهُوَ مُحَرَّمٌ عَلَيْكُمْ إِخْرَاجُهُمْ ۚ أَفَتُؤْمِنُونَ بِبَعْضِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَتَكْفُرُونَ بِبَعْضٍ ۚ فَمَا جَزَآءُ مَن يَفْعَلُ ذَٰلِكَ مِنكُمْ إِلَّا خِزْىٌ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَيَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ يُرَدُّونَ إِلَىٰٓ أَشَدِّ ٱلْعَذَابِ ۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ بِغَـٰفِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet here you are, killing one another and driving some of your own people from their homes, helping one another in sin and aggression against them. If they come to you as captives, you still pay to set them free, although you had no right to drive them out. So do you believe in some parts of the Scripture and not in others? The punishment for those of you who do this will be nothing but disgrace in this life, and on the Day of Resurrection they will be condemned to the harshest torment: God is not unaware of what you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"(are) those","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَقْتُلُونَ","en_gloss":"(who) kill","transliteration":"taqtulūna","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفُسَكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusakum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَتُخْرِجُونَ","en_gloss":"and evict","transliteration":"watukh'rijūna","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَرِيقًۭا","en_gloss":"a party","transliteration":"farīqan","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنكُم","en_gloss":"of you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their homes","transliteration":"diyārihim","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَظَـٰهَرُونَ","en_gloss":"you support one another","transliteration":"taẓāharūna","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِٱلْإِثْمِ","en_gloss":"in sin","transliteration":"bil-ith'mi","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","en_gloss":"and [the] transgression","transliteration":"wal-ʿud'wāni","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَأْتُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"they come to you","transliteration":"yatūkum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُسَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(as) captives","transliteration":"usārā","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تُفَـٰدُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you ransom them","transliteration":"tufādūhum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while it","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مُحَرَّمٌ","en_gloss":"(was) forbidden","transliteration":"muḥarramun","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":21,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِخْرَاجُهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their eviction","transliteration":"ikh'rājuhum","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَفَتُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"So do you believe","transliteration":"afatu'minūna","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِبَعْضِ","en_gloss":"in part (of)","transliteration":"bibaʿḍi","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَتَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"and disbelieve","transliteration":"watakfurūna","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بِبَعْضٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"in part","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":28,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"Then what","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"2:85"},{"pos":29,"ar":"جَزَآءُ","en_gloss":"(should be the) recompense","