:50,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:85"}]},{"verse_key":"2:86","surah":2,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱشْتَرَوُا۟ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ فَلَا يُخَفَّفُ عَنْهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ وَلَا هُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"These are the people who buy the life of this world at the price of the Hereafter: their torment will not be lightened, nor will they be helped.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱشْتَرَوُا۟","en_gloss":"bought","transliteration":"ish'tarawū","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayata","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"for the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُخَفَّفُ","en_gloss":"will be lightened","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَنْهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿanhumu","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُنصَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be helped","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","verse_key":"2:86"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٦","en_gloss":"(86)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:86"}]},{"verse_key":"2:87","surah":2,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَى ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَقَفَّيْنَا مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ بِٱلرُّسُلِ ۖ وَءَاتَيْنَا عِيسَى ٱبْنَ مَرْيَمَ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ بِرُوحِ ٱلْقُدُسِ ۗ أَفَكُلَّمَا جَآءَكُمْ رَسُولٌۢ بِمَا لَا تَهْوَىٰٓ أَنفُسُكُمُ ٱسْتَكْبَرْتُمْ فَفَرِيقًا كَذَّبْتُمْ وَفَرِيقًا تَقْتُلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave Moses the Scripture and We sent messengers after him in succession. We gave Jesus, son of Mary, clear signs and strengthened him with the Holy Spirit. So how is it that, whenever a messenger brings you something you do not like, you become arrogant, calling some impostors and killing others?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We gave","transliteration":"ātaynā","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَى","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَقَفَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"and We followed up","transliteration":"waqaffaynā","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"after him","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلرُّسُلِ ۖ","en_gloss":"with [the] Messengers","transliteration":"bil-rusuli","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We gave","transliteration":"waātaynā","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"ʿīsā","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱبْنَ","en_gloss":"(the) son","transliteration":"ib'na","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] clear signs","transliteration":"l-bayināti","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We supported him","transliteration":"wa-ayyadnāhu","verse_key":"2:87"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِرُوحِ","en_gloss":"(with)","transliteration":"birūḥi","verse_key"